## 3. Comprehensive Services Offered

### 3.1 Septic Tank Pumping & Sewage Disposal (บริการดูดส้วม สูบส้วม และบ่อเกรอะ)
- **Target Systems**: Residential cesspools, septic tanks (ถังแซท), concrete holding tanks, anaerobic digestors, commercial waste pits.
- **Procedures**: Deep sludge extraction, bottom crust breakdown, vacuum removal without foul odors escaping, gas vent line inspection, and sanitizing.
- **Price Range**: Starting from 1,xxx THB for standard residential homes. Final pricing depends on tank volume, hose length, and access.

### 3.2 High-Speed Electric Drain Clearing (บริการแก้ไขท่อตันด้วยงูเหล็กไฟฟ้า)
- **Target Fixtures**: Clogged toilets (ชักโครกตัน), bathroom floor drains, kitchen sinks, grease lines, roof drainage, and main lateral sewer lines.
- **Technology**: Heavy-duty electric rooter snakes (เครื่องงูเหล็กกำลังสูง) capable of clearing grease calcification, hair, roots, wipes, and debris up to 30-50 meters deep without breaking or damaging PVC pipes.
- **Guarantee**: "ไม่หายไม่คิดเงิน" (Results-based guarantee; assessed on site).
- **Price Range**: Starting from 1,xxx THB per drainage point.

### 3.3 Grease Trap Pumping, Cleaning & Installation (บริการล้างและติดตั้งถังดักไขมัน)
- **Target Clients**: Restaurants, cafes, hotels, resorts, commercial bakeries, food courts, and private residential kitchens.
- **Procedures**: Complete skimming and pumping of coagulated oil and grease, wall scraping, basket deodorization, outlet trap unclogging, and scheduled bi-weekly, monthly, or quarterly preventive maintenance.
- **Compliance**: Providing legal waste disposal receipts (ใบกำจัดไขมันและสิ่งปฏิกูล) for municipal sanitation health inspections.

### 3.4 Drainage Line Dredging & Silt Removal (บริการขุดลอกท่อระบายน้ำและบ่อพัก)
- **Target Sites**: Housing estates (หมู่บ้านจัดสรร), condominium compounds, municipal access roads, private alleys, hotel properties.
- **Procedures**: Removal of heavy road sediment, sand, rocks, decayed organic leaves, and construction slurry to restore maximum hydraulic flow before the rainy/monsoon season.

### 3.5 Fresh Water Storage Tank Cleaning & Sanitization (บริการล้างทำความสะอาดถังเก็บน้ำ)
- **Target Systems**: Underground concrete tanks, stainless steel tanks, and rooftop polymer water storage tanks.
- **Procedures**: Complete drainage, high-pressure washing, moss/sediment removal, chlorine disinfection, and sediment filter flushing for residential and hospitality hygiene.

### 3.6 Wastewater Treatment System Installation & Relocation (บริการวางระบบถังบำบัดน้ำเสีย)
- **Services**: Ground excavation, septic tank installation (ถังบำบัดสำเร็จรูป), soakaway pit construction (บ่อซึม), lateral pipe slope leveling, and retrofitting old concrete cesspools into modern odor-free closed systems.

### 3.7 Water Pipe Reconfiguration & Underground Plumbing (บริการวางและย้ายระบบท่อน้ำ)
- **Services**: Re-routing drainage and sewage pipes, fixing misaligned pipe gradients that cause recurring standing water, installing check valves, and solving recurring backflow issues.

### 3.8 Sanitary Fixture Repair & Installation (บริการซ่อมและติดตั้งสุขภัณฑ์)
- **Services**: Toilet bowl reset, wax ring seal replacement to cure sewer gas odors, floor drain trap upgrades, and toilet mechanism replacements.

